\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {R4}{\ignorespaces Figure\nobreakspace  {}R4.\nobreakspace  Mean ThyClinScore of each method when one parameter of ThyClinScore was varied at a time. Each panel varies one parameter over five values, with all other parameters at their default values (dotted line). Configurations in which two parameters were varied jointly, and the component weights, are shown in Figure\nobreakspace  {}\ref  {fig_rep_sensitivity_ranks}. The KMVE model was not evaluated on KMVE.\relax }}{14}{figure.caption.19}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig_rep_sensitivity_curves}{{R4}{14}{\responsefiguretitle {fig_rep_sensitivity_curves}{Mean ThyClinScore of each method when one parameter of ThyClinScore was varied at a time. Each panel varies one parameter over five values, with all other parameters at their default values (dotted line). Configurations in which two parameters were varied jointly, and the component weights, are shown in \responsefigureref {fig_rep_sensitivity_ranks}. The KMVE model was not evaluated on KMVE.}\relax }{figure.caption.19}{}}
\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {R5}{\ignorespaces Figure\nobreakspace  {}R5.\nobreakspace  Ranking of ThyroidXAgent by mean ThyClinScore across the 120 parameter configurations. Each cell is one configuration: three 5 $\times $ 5 grids in which two parameters were varied jointly, each of the six consistency weights w and five completeness weights u varied from 0.5 to 1.5 times its default value, and three variants with equal weights. Values are the mean ThyClinScore of ThyroidXAgent minus that of the highest-scoring other method under the same configuration (blue, ThyroidXAgent first); where ThyroidXAgent was not first, its rank is given. Black outline, default parameters. KMVE reports record no gland measurements and few lesion sizes, so the size tolerances $\tau $ have almost no effect on KMVE.\relax }}{15}{figure.caption.20}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig_rep_sensitivity_ranks}{{R5}{15}{\responsefiguretitle {fig_rep_sensitivity_ranks}{Ranking of ThyroidXAgent by mean ThyClinScore across the 120 parameter configurations. Each cell is one configuration: three 5 $\times $ 5 grids in which two parameters were varied jointly, each of the six consistency weights w and five completeness weights u varied from 0.5 to 1.5 times its default value, and three variants with equal weights. Values are the mean ThyClinScore of ThyroidXAgent minus that of the highest-scoring other method under the same configuration (blue, ThyroidXAgent first); where ThyroidXAgent was not first, its rank is given. Black outline, default parameters. KMVE reports record no gland measurements and few lesion sizes, so the size tolerances $\tau $ have almost no effect on KMVE.}\relax }{figure.caption.20}{}}
